  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The YEC was established according to the Ministry of interior license number (8050) in the year 2008 as a youth initiative to meet the community requirements, the YEC was founded to lead children, adolescents,  and youth to discover their purpose throughsocial, emotional, mental and physical development opportunities, while promoting positive change in the community.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Empowerment Center</narrative>
